raw_excerpt:
Working with 
@citrini
, we asked Claude to design proteins that bind to five scorpion toxins (covering the part of the toxin that latches onto cells).

Over the next 64 hours, Claude generated over 300,000 designs; we sent 211 to 
@adaptyvbio
 and 
@TwistBioscience
 for lab testing.

